flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>Begin MOO optimization workflow"]
InitPopulation["**Initialize Population**<br/>Create initial candidate flag vectors"]
EvaluatePopulation["**Evaluate Population**<br/>Call ProcessTimeReductionProblem evaluate"]
IndividualFlags["**Individual Flags**<br/>Decision vector of binary flags {0 1} for 7 machines"]
FeasibilityCheck["**Feasibility Check**<br/>Ensure flags are binary and constraints met"]
ParallelExecutor["**Parallel Executor**<br/>ProcessPoolExecutor with fixed workers for replications"]
EvalReplication["**Evaluate Single Replication**<br/>evaluate_single_replication computes throughput wip energy"]
RunSimWithFlags["**Run Simulation With Flags**<br/>run_simulation_with_process_flags wrapper"]
ApplyOverrides["**Apply Overrides**<br/>Backup global overrides then set PROCESS_TIME_OVERRIDES"]
RestoreOverrides["**Restore Overrides**<br/>Restore global PROCESS_TIME_OVERRIDES after run"]
RunSimulation["**Run Simulation**<br/>Set up simpy Environment run warmup sampling and measurement"]
BuildEnvMachines["**Build Environment and Machines**<br/>Create DelayBuffer and Machine instances with get_pt reading overrides"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer Class**<br/>Attributes cap delay store tokens methods put get in_transit_count free_capacity"]
MachineClass["**Machine Class**<br/>Attributes process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power methods run breakdown energy computations"]
PartGenerator["**Part Generator**<br/>Continually produces parts into raw input store"]
SampleWIP["**Sample WIP**<br/>Periodically sample ready in transit and in machine counts"]
ComputeMetrics["**Compute Metrics**<br/>Compute throughput wip produced parts and energy per machine and per part"]
ReturnReplicationResult["**Return Replication Result**<br/>Throughput wip energy per part or infeasible marker"]
AggregateResults["**Aggregate Replications**<br/>Collect replications per individual compute mean wip mean energy"]
UpdateObjectives["**Update Objective Array**<br/>Set F row for individual with aggregated objectives"]
NSGA2Algorithm["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Selection crossover mutation eliminate duplicates iterate generations"]
VariationOperators["**Variation Operators**<br/>Sampling crossover mutation produce next population"]
Termination["**Termination Check**<br/>Stop when generation budget reached"]
ExportCSV["**Export History**<br/>Export feasible solutions and KPIs to CSV file"]
End["**End**<br/>Optimization complete and results exported"]

Start --> InitPopulation
InitPopulation --> EvaluatePopulation
EvaluatePopulation --> IndividualFlags
IndividualFlags --> FeasibilityCheck
FeasibilityCheck -- valid --> ParallelExecutor
FeasibilityCheck -- invalid --> UpdateObjectives
ParallelExecutor --> EvalReplication
EvalReplication --> RunSimWithFlags
RunSimWithFlags --> ApplyOverrides
ApplyOverrides --> RunSimulation
RunSimulation --> BuildEnvMachines
BuildEnvMachines --> DelayBufferClass
BuildEnvMachines --> MachineClass
BuildEnvMachines --> PartGenerator
RunSimulation --> SampleWIP
SampleWIP --> ComputeMetrics
ComputeMetrics --> ReturnReplicationResult
ReturnReplicationResult --> RestoreOverrides
RestoreOverrides --> EvalReplication
EvalReplication --> AggregateResults
AggregateResults --> UpdateObjectives
UpdateObjectives --> NSGA2Algorithm
NSGA2Algorithm --> VariationOperators
VariationOperators --> EvaluatePopulation
NSGA2Algorithm --> Termination
Termination -- not finished --> VariationOperators
Termination -- finished --> ExportCSV
ExportCSV --> End